{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Theme Orange"}],"title":"DividerComponentTokens Implementations","roleHeading":"API Collection","role":"collectionGroup"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeDividerComponentTokensProvider\/borderWidth"],"generated":true}],"sections":[],"kind":"article","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemedividercomponenttokensprovider\/dividercomponenttokens-implementations"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeDividerComponentTokensProvider\/DividerComponentTokens-Implementations","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeDividerComponentTokensProvider"]]},"references":{"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange","kind":"symbol","title":"Theme Orange","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","role":"collection","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The Orange theme overrides some tokens from the basic "},{"code":"OUDSTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and should be seen as the default theme for the OUDS library with the Orange brand colors for example."}]},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeDividerComponentTokensProvider":{"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeDividerComponentTokensProvider","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A class which wraps all "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"component  tokens of divider"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" for "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"divider","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" objects like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSHorizontalDivider"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSVerticalDivider"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Contains also references to semantic tokens providers so as to be able to use them to define the component tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllDividerComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all tokens to the users. It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation to use."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Custom themes can use subclass of "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeDividerComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" and apply the provider they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It implements also the protocol "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DividerComponentTokens"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to expose the component tokens for "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"divider","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" through any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Divider"}]},{"type":"text","text":" components tokens are defined with raw and semantic tokens of borders (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllBorderSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeThemeDividerComponentTokensProvider"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OrangeThemeDividerComponentTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","title":"OrangeThemeDividerComponentTokensProvider","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemedividercomponenttokensprovider"},"ic_theme_orange.png":{"type":"image","alt":null,"identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png","variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesOrange\/ic_theme_orange.png"}]},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeDividerComponentTokensProvider/borderWidth":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeDividerComponentTokensProvider\/borderWidth","abstract":[{"text":"Has for value token borders.widthThin","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemedividercomponenttokensprovider\/borderwidth","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"borderWidth"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSTokensSemantic011BorderWidthB5Tokena","text":"BorderWidthSemanticToken"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"borderWidth"}}}